# Golden LED stream for ihub-driver-integration-test (T044).
# One outbound MIDI message per line, in order, timestamps excluded.
# 16 startup LEDs (pad 0..15 idle), then pads 0..7 pressed:
#   previous active pad -> idle, new pad -> warming, then -> active
# Pads 8..15 are unmapped and emit nothing.

